          "en": "NPZ mask import for region comparison",
          "zh-CN": "区域比较支持导入 NPZ 掩膜"
        },
        {
          "en": "Export differential and enriched ions from comparisons",
          "zh-CN": "比较结果可导出差异与富集离子"
        },
        {
          "en": "New HMDB database page with filtering and CSV download",
          "zh-CN": "新增 HMDB 数据库页，支持筛选与下载"
        },
        {
          "en": "Import full annotation libraries from the platform, reused locally",
          "zh-CN": "注释库可从平台整库导入并复用"
        },
        {
          "en": "New database guide and annotation guide updates",
          "zh-CN": "新增数据库指南，注释指南更新"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "date": {
        "en": "October 9",
